#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:232
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: Apple uses shadow extremely sparingly. The primary"
" shadow (`3px 5px 30px` with 0.22 opacity) is soft, wide, and offset — "
"mimicking a diffused studio light casting a natural shadow beneath a "
"physical object. This reinforces the \"product as physical sculpture\" "
"metaphor. Most elements have NO shadow at all; elevation comes from "
"background color contrast (dark card on darker background, or light card "
"on slightly different gray)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:234
msgid "Decorative Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:235
msgid ""
"Navigation glass: the translucent, blurred navigation bar is the most "
"recognizable depth element, creating a sense of floating UI above "
"scrolling content"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:236
msgid ""
"Section color transitions: depth is implied by the alternation between "
"black and light gray sections rather than by shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:237
msgid ""
"Product photography shadows: the products themselves cast shadows in "
"their photography, so the UI doesn't need to add synthetic ones"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:239
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:241
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:242
msgid ""
"Use SF Pro Display at 20px+ and SF Pro Text below 20px — respect the "
"optical sizing boundary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:243
msgid ""
"Apply negative letter-spacing at all text sizes (not just headlines) — "
"Apple tracks tight universally"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:244
msgid ""
"Use Apple Blue (`#0071e3`) ONLY for interactive elements — it must be the"
" singular accent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:245
msgid ""
"Alternate between black and light gray (`#f5f5f7`) section backgrounds "
"for cinematic rhythm"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:246
msgid "Use 980px pill radius for CTA links — the signature Apple link shape"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:247
msgid ""
"Keep product imagery on solid-color fields with no competing visual "
"elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:248
msgid ""
"Use the translucent dark glass (`rgba(0,0,0,0.8)` + blur) for sticky "
"navigation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:249
msgid ""
"Compress headline line-heights to 1.07-1.14 — Apple headlines are "
"famously tight"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:251
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:252
msgid ""
"Don't introduce additional accent colors — the entire chromatic budget is"
" spent on blue"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:253
msgid ""
"Don't use heavy shadows or multiple shadow layers — Apple's shadow system"
" is one soft diffused shadow or nothing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:254
msgid ""
"Don't use borders on cards or containers — Apple almost never uses "
"visible borders (except on specific buttons)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:255
msgid ""
"Don't apply wide letter-spacing to SF Pro — it is designed to run tight "
"at every size"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:256
msgid ""
"Don't use weight 800 or 900 — the maximum is 700 (bold), and even that is"
" rare"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:257
msgid ""
"Don't add textures, patterns, or gradients to backgrounds — solid colors "
"only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:258
msgid ""
"Don't make the navigation opaque — the glass blur effect is essential to "
"the Apple UI identity"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:259
msgid ""
"Don't center-align body text — Apple body copy is left-aligned; only "
"headlines center"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_apple.md:260
msgid ""
"Don't use rounded corners larger than 12px on rectangular elements (980px"
" is for pills only)"
msgstr ""

